prompt:
Match new answers to existing unanswered questions.
Rules: - Output ONLY lines in the exact format MAPPING | answerId=<id> | questionId=<id> | confidence=<0.0-1.0>. - Only include mappings with confidence >= 0.6. - Each answer maps to AT MOST ONE question. - A question may have multiple answers. - If no good matches, output nothing.
New answers: ${answersText}
Existing questions: ${questionsText} ${extraInstructions}
